---
import { CONFIG } from '../config/index';
---

<article>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-28 text-center sm:px-8 sm:py-32">
    <span class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-foam/[0.14] px-3.5 py-[7px] font-mono text-[12.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-mist before:content-['·'] before:text-[22px] before:leading-none before:text-amber">
      únete
    </span>

    <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-[640px] font-display text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,46px)] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
      Aínda estamos empezando. Ven axudar a construílo.
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[460px] text-lg leading-relaxed text-foam/[0.8]">
      Un só sitio, sen ruído: o grupo de Telegram. Eventos, proxectos e
      conversa, todo aí.
    </p>

    <a href={CONFIG.TELEGRAM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-[3px] bg-amber px-8 py-[18px] font-mono text-[15px] font-medium text-deep-2 transition-all hover:-translate-y-px hover:bg-amber-light focus-visible:-translate-y-px focus-visible:bg-amber-light focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-foam">
      Únete ao Telegram de Vigo404 →
    </a>

    <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-mist">
      sen spam, sen ruído — só a comunidade
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
